Dataset
 └── Stratified K-Fold (K = 5)
      ├── Fold i
      │    ├── Training fold (80%)
      │    │    ├── Training CNN (90%)
      │    │    └── Validation CNN (10%)  ← CNN_VAL_RATIO
      │    └── Test fold (20%)             ← evaluasi fold
      └── Rata-rata akurasi seluruh fold
